    Bug 2001107 - Do not get message header for .eml messages in Enigmail compose. r=mkmelin


    This inlines the Enigmail.msg.getMsgHdr(msgUri) and getOriginalMsgUri()
    functions. URIs for draft messages are no longer mutated, as this rendered URIs
    for draft file messages invalid and does not seem necessary in other cases.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D273205

